WEBVTT

00:00.167 --> 00:02.833
Sending wallet addresses in Telegram?

00:03.000 --> 00:05.333
Create an invoice.

00:05.667 --> 00:08.000
No signup.

00:08.333 --> 00:10.667
No account. No KYC.

00:11.000 --> 00:15.000
Get a link.

00:15.000 --> 00:17.333
Invoice ready.

00:17.667 --> 00:19.833
The link is the invoice.

00:20.167 --> 00:22.500
Hash never leaves the browser.

00:22.833 --> 00:24.833
Share it anywhere.

00:24.834 --> 00:26.667
Payer opens the link.

00:27.000 --> 00:29.500
No intermediary.

00:30.667 --> 00:33.333
Unique amount. Unique payment.

00:34.333 --> 00:37.000
Exact on-chain match.

00:37.000 --> 00:39.000
Payment confirmed.

00:39.000 --> 00:41.000
Not our servers.

00:41.000 --> 00:43.500
Works even if we shut down.
